You should estimate \uc0\u955  from observed behaviour rather than arbitrarily increasing it.\
For example:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \uc0\u955 ^=arg\u955 max t\u8721  logP\u955  (pt 
\f3 \uc0\u8739 
\f0 competitor\'a0behaviourt ).\
