\cf0 Now \uc0\u955  is estimated from actual pricing decisions.\
If the estimated \uc0\u955  is low, that's evidence of substantial stochasticity / imperfect response.\
If it's very high, the data are telling you behaviour is close to best response.\
That's an empirical question rather than a modelling preference.\
