\cf0 \uc0\u963 i max [E\u963 i [Ui ]+\u955 1 H(\u963 i )]\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 where\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 H(\uc0\u963 i )=\u8722 a\u8721  \u963 i (a)ln\u963 i (a)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 is Shannon entropy.\
The solution is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \uc0\u963 i (a)=\u8721 b exp(\u955 Ui (b))exp(\u955 Ui (a)) .\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 That's precisely the 
\f1\b logit response
\f0\b0 .\
